{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2023-02-27 19:44:00', 'title': 'AT&T CFO UPDATES SHAREHOLDERS AT THE ANNUAL DEUTSCHE BANK MEDIA, INTERNET & TELECOM CONFERENCE', 'text': 'DALLAS , FEB. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PASCAL DESROCHES, SENIOR EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AT&T INC., AT&T* (NYSE:T) SPOKE TODAY AT THE ANNUAL DEUTSCHE BANK MEDIA, INTERNET & TELECOM CONFERENCE WHERE HE PROVIDED AN UPDATE TO SHAREHOLDERS. DESROCHES MADE THE FOLLOWING POINTS: THE COMPANY CONTINUES TO FOCUS ITS EFFORTS ON 5G AND FIBER SERVICES BY GROWING CUSTOMER RELATIONSHIPS IN A DISCIPLINED MANNER.'}